{"3775270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Doctor Dreams Simulator", "steam_appid": 3775270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Free To Play</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/592c84ec6fd3f4a0f912305d3d54dc2c.avif?t=1783775818\" width=1156 height=163 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step into medieval nightmares and face the fears that lurk in the darkness.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i><strong>Doctor Dreams Simulator</strong></i>, you enter the dreams of those who come to your clinic, exploring dark fantasy worlds where each nightmare presents a unique challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/2a6e814b19904ec2cfb0e967882f561f.poster.avif?t=1783775818\" width=1170 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/2a6e814b19904ec2cfb0e967882f561f.webm?t=1783775818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/2a6e814b19904ec2cfb0e967882f561f.mp4?t=1783775818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Confront relentless enemies, overcome unexpected situations, and master ever-changing scenarios in every dream.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/e3ab07a0e6a45bec337fb46fdd3f2906.poster.avif?t=1783775818\" width=1170 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/e3ab07a0e6a45bec337fb46fdd3f2906.webm?t=1783775818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/e3ab07a0e6a45bec337fb46fdd3f2906.mp4?t=1783775818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your clinic, prepare treatments, and protect your reputation while a rival clinic attempts to sabotage your work from the shadows.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/e24b2db8112afbdb9af8a9d4ed2775d9.poster.avif?t=1783775818\" width=1170 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/e24b2db8112afbdb9af8a9d4ed2775d9.webm?t=1783775818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/e24b2db8112afbdb9af8a9d4ed2775d9.mp4?t=1783775818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medieval nightmares with unique challenges in every scenario</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clinic management with decisions that affect your reputation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suspicious patients and sabotage from a rival clinic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and improve treatments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story filled with mystery and progressive discoveries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline c